    {
      "text": "Happy art thou, O Israel, Deut. 33:29. happy is the man whom God correcteth, Job 5:17. Happy is the man that hath his quiver full of them, Ps. 127:5. happy shalt thou be, Ps. 128:2. Happy is that people, that is in such a case, Ps. 144:15. Happy is he that hath the God of Jacob for his help, Ps. 146:5. Happy is the man that findeth wisdom, Prov. 3:13. hath mercy on the poor, happy is he, Prov. 14:21. trusteth in the Lord, happy is he, Prov. 16:20. keepeth the law, happy is he, Prov. 29:18. let thy heart cheer thee in … thy youth, Eccl. 11:9.",
